 "sentences": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 3.18,
   "text": "Saving recipes feels like learning to cook. It isn't."
  },
  {
   "s": 3.46,
   "e": 6.16,
   "text": "Here's why. It's Tuesday, 7 in the evening, and you're tired."
  },
  {
   "s": 6.74,
   "e": 10.84,
   "text": "You open your 200 saved recipes, scroll for 20 minutes, and end up making toast."
  },
  {
   "s": 11.32,
   "e": 14.28,
   "text": "Do that four nights a week, and that's 80 minutes just deciding."
  },
  {
   "s": 14.9,
   "e": 17.36,
   "text": "And you're still no better at cooking than you were in January."
  },
  {
   "s": 17.98,
   "e": 19.68,
   "text": "So here's the fix. Stop collecting."
  },
  {
   "s": 19.98,
   "e": 22.96,
   "text": "Pick three dinners you'd happily eat every week and master just those."
  },
  {
   "s": 23.38,
   "e": 25.52,
   "text": "Say dal, a tomato, pasta, and a bean chili."
  },
  {
   "s": 25.52,
   "e": 30.02,
   "text": "Cook each one twice this week. By the second time, you'll barely look at the recipe."
  },
  {
   "s": 30.44,
   "e": 34.74,
   "text": "And write one shopping list for all three. They share the same base, onions, tomatoes,"
  },
  {
   "s": 34.98,
   "e": 39.06,
   "text": "and garlic so nothing goes to waste. So what does your week look like by Sunday?"
  },
  {
   "s": 39.86,
   "e": 44.8,
   "text": "Three recipes, six home dinners, and zero minutes standing at the fridge wondering what to make."
  },
  {
   "s": 45.26,
   "e": 48.2,
   "text": "Here's the rule. Pick three. Cook each one twice. One list."
  },
  {
   "s": 48.48,
   "e": 50.86,
   "text": "Send this to the friend with 300 saved recipes."
  },
  {
   "s": 51.32,
   "e": 55.6,
   "text": "That's what Demure is for. You archive your dream today so you can see it tomorrow"
  },
  {
   "s": 55.6,
   "e": 58.4,
   "text": "and break it down into small steps you can actually do."
  },
  {
   "s": 58.82,
   "e": 63.52,
   "text": "And follow because this afternoon's real is how 20 minutes a day turned into a wedding gift."
  },
  {
   "s": 64.02,
   "e": 66.52,
   "text": "If you want to try it out, I've put the link in the bio."
  }
 ],
 "wps": 3.35
}